<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/"><channel><title>中小企业 on AI驱动数字化转型</title><link>https://zhengjinjun1975.github.io/tags/%E4%B8%AD%E5%B0%8F%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A/</link><description>Recent content in 中小企业 on AI驱动数字化转型</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://zhengjinjun1975.github.io/tags/%E4%B8%AD%E5%B0%8F%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>大厂砸钱堆大模型，中小厂靠"本体"把AI用起来，这才是新思路</title><link>https://zhengjinjun1975.github.io/2026/08/ontology-sme-ai/</link><pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://zhengjinjun1975.github.io/2026/08/ontology-sme-ai/</guid><description>大厂能投几个亿买算力，中小厂一年的信息技术预算够不够一台像样的服务器都难说。让中小厂在模型规模上跟巨头竞争不现实。本体这条路，给了中小厂一个现实的答案。</description></item><item><title>工厂本体 factory-ontology：本体问答工具开源，让中小企业台账学会说话</title><link>https://zhengjinjun1975.github.io/2026/08/%E5%B7%A5%E5%8E%82%E6%9C%AC%E4%BD%93-factory-ontology%E6%9C%AC%E4%BD%93%E9%97%AE%E7%AD%94%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E5%BC%80%E6%BA%90%E8%AE%A9%E4%B8%AD%E5%B0%8F%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%E5%8F%B0%E8%B4%A6%E5%AD%A6%E4%BC%9A%E8%AF%B4%E8%AF%9D/</link><pubDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://zhengjinjun1975.github.io/2026/08/%E5%B7%A5%E5%8E%82%E6%9C%AC%E4%BD%93-factory-ontology%E6%9C%AC%E4%BD%93%E9%97%AE%E7%AD%94%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E5%BC%80%E6%BA%90%E8%AE%A9%E4%B8%AD%E5%B0%8F%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%E5%8F%B0%E8%B4%A6%E5%AD%A6%E4%BC%9A%E8%AF%B4%E8%AF%9D/</guid><description>数据躺在MES、ERP、Excel台账里，业务人员不会SQL，老师傅凭经验拍脑袋。factory-ontology用本体给数据划定语义边界，让机器在边界内确定性回答，让台账变成能对话、能溯源、能沉淀的资产。</description></item></channel></rss>